<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | Alpha Hill Medical Centre — Nandi County</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="How Alpha Hill Medical Centre in Mosoriot, Nandi County collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website. Draft for legal review, August 2026."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= site %>/privacy" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#001F5D" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Alpha Hill Medical Centre" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Privacy Policy | Alpha Hill Medical Centre" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="How we collect, use and protect information submitted through the Alpha Hill Medical Centre website."
    />
    <meta property="og:url" content="<%= site %>/privacy" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/alphahillmedicallogo.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('partials/public-header', { current: '' }) %>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="section">
        <div class="container policy">
          <p class="breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Privacy Policy
          </p>
          <p class="eyebrow">Your information</p>
          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            This draft is provided for the owner’s legal review. Last updated
            August 2026.
          </p>

          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            Alpha Hill Medical Centre is a 24-hour hospital along Mosoriot –
            Kabiyet Road, Mosoriot, Nandi County, Kenya. You can contact us at
            <a href="mailto:alphahillmedical@gmail.com">alphahillmedical@gmail.com</a>
            or
            <a href="tel:+254722865459">+254 722 865 459</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            This website is a public information and enquiry site. It is
            <strong>not</strong> a patient portal and it is
            <strong>not</strong> a medical-records system. Please do not submit
            sensitive health details, test results, diagnoses or copies of
            medical records through the public forms.
          </p>

          <h2>Information we collect</h2>
          <p>When you use our website we may collect:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Enquiry and appointment forms:</strong> name, phone
              number, email address, the service you are asking about, preferred
              date and time, and the message you write.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Career applications:</strong> name, phone, email,
              position, opportunity type, cover letter and any CV link you
              provide.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Newsletter sign-up:</strong> your email address.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Reviews:</strong> name, optional email, optional phone
              number, rating, service, and your comments. Reviews are checked
              by staff before they appear on the website. Phone numbers and
              email addresses are never published with a review.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>First-party visit counts:</strong> only if you accept
              cookies, a random visitor identifier and the pages you view. We
              do not store your IP address in plaintext and we do not record
              your browser’s User-Agent on staff screens. See our
              <a href="/cookies">Cookies Policy</a>.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>How we use this information</h2>
          <p>We use the information you send us to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>respond to enquiries and appointment requests;</li>
            <li>consider job, internship and volunteer applications;</li>
            <li>send news and event updates if you subscribe;</li>
            <li>moderate and, where you have agreed, publish reviews; and</li>
            <li>
              understand which public pages are visited, so we can improve the
              website.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We do not sell your information. We do not use Google Analytics,
            Facebook Pixel, Hotjar, Microsoft Clarity or other third-party
            advertising or behaviour-tracking tools on this site.
          </p>

          <h2>Legal basis and Kenya data protection</h2>
          <p>
            We process website form data so we can take steps at your request
            before a contract (for example an appointment) and because we have a
            legitimate interest in running a hospital website and responding to
            the public. Where Kenyan law (including the Data Protection Act,
            2019) requires consent — such as optional marketing emails or
            optional analytics cookies — we ask for it and you may withdraw it.
          </p>
          <p>
            Clinical records created during a hospital visit are held under our
            clinical systems and professional duties of confidentiality. They
            are separate from this website.
          </p>

          <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
          <p>
            Website enquiries, appointment requests, applications, subscriptions
            and reviews are kept for as long as staff need them to follow up
            and for ordinary hospital administration, then deleted or archived
            according to our internal records practice. Analytics counts are
            kept to produce all-time and recent totals on the staff dashboard.
          </p>

          <h2>Sharing</h2>
          <p>
            Access is limited to authorised Alpha Hill Medical Centre staff.
            We may disclose information if required by Kenyan law, a court or a
            regulator, or to protect someone’s vital interests in an emergency.
          </p>

          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You may ask to access, correct or delete personal information we
            hold from this website, or to withdraw cookie consent, by emailing
            <a href="mailto:alphahillmedical@gmail.com">alphahillmedical@gmail.com</a>
            or calling
            <a href="tel:+254722865459">+254 722 865 459</a>. You may also
            contact the Office of the Data Protection Commissioner of Kenya if
            you have a complaint.
          </p>

          <h2>Children</h2>
          <p>
            This website is intended for adults making enquiries about care,
            visiting or working with us. Please do not submit a child’s detailed
            medical information through a public form.
          </p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Alpha Hill Medical Centre<br />
            Along Mosoriot – Kabiyet Road, Mosoriot, Nandi County<br />
            P.O. Box 8620–30100<br />
            <a href="mailto:alphahillmedical@gmail.com">alphahillmedical@gmail.com</a
            ><br />
            <a href="tel:+254722865459">+254 722 865 459</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
    <script src="/assets/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
